# ==============================================================================
# JEV Cscape Agent - Environment Configuration Template (Gate G12 / W092)
# Copy this file to `.env` and populate your API key before running live AI tasks.
# NEVER commit `.env` to git (enforced by `.gitignore` and W094 scanner).
